                        global.msg[0] = stringsetloc(""* PONMAN fell asleep^1!&* SUSIE fell asleep^1!&* The enemies became TIRED!/%"", ""obj_ponman_enemy_slash_Step_0_gml_198_0"");
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        sleeping = 1;
        scr_mercyadd(myself, 100);
        with (obj_monsterparent)
        {
            global.monstercomment[myself] = ""(Sleepy)"";
            global.monsterstatus[myself] = 1;
        }
        scr_battletext_default();
        actcon = 1;
    }
}
if (global.myfight == 7)
{
    hspeed = 15 / global.fps_scale;
}
if (sleeping == 1)
{
    eyecon = 999;
}
if (eyecon == 0)
{
    eye_angle = 180 + (sin(siner / 8) * 30);
    if (eye_radius < 8)
    {
        eye_radius += (2 / global.fps_scale);
    }
    else
    {
        eye_radius = 8;
    }
    if (addup == 0)
    {
        image_index = 1;
    }
    else
    {
        image_index = 3;
    }
    if (eye_angle > 200)
    {
        image_index = 0;
        addup = 1;
    }
    if (eye_angle < 160)
    {
        image_index = 2;
        addup = 0;
    }
}
if (eyecon == 10)
{
    activetimer = 0;
    with (obj_regularbullet)
    {
        active = 0;
        image_alpha -= (0.1 / global.fps_scale);
    }
    image_index = 0;
    eye_radius *= power(0.7, 1 / global.fps_scale);
    if (abs(eye_radius) < 0.5)
    {
        eye_radius = 0;
        eye_angle = 0;
    }
    if (global.turntimer <= 1)
    {
        eyecon = 0;
    }
}
if (eyecon == 20)
{
    if (spinspeed < 10)
    {
        spinspeed += (1 / global.fps_scale);
    }
    if (pontotal > 1)
    {
        siner += (spinspeed / 8 / global.fps_scale);
    }
    else
    {
        siner += (spinspeed / 20 / global.fps_scale);
    }
    eye_angle = 180 + (sin(siner / 8) * 70);
    if (eye_radius < 8)
    {
        eye_radius += (1 / global.fps_scale);
    }
    grandbuffer -= 1;
    if (instance_exists(obj_heart))
    {
        x_angle = point_direction(eyex + 28 + x, eyey + 32 + y, obj_heart.x + 8, obj_heart.y + 8);
    }
    else
    {
        x_angle = 0;
    }
    if (abs(x_angle - eye_angle) < 25 && eye_angle >= 120 && eye_angle <= 240)
    {
        if (shotbuffer < 0 && shotcount < 3 && totalshotcount < maxshot)
        {
            shotcount += 1;
            if (pontotal == 2)
            {
                shotcount += 1;
            }
            if (pontotal == 3)
            {
                shotcount += 1;
            }
            if (shotcount >= 3)
            {
                totalshotcount += 1;
                shotcount = 0;
                if (pontotal == 1)
                {
                    shotbuffer = 10;
                }
                if (pontotal == 2)
                {
                    shotbuffer = 13;
                }
                if (pontotal == 3)
                {
                    shotbuffer = 22;
                }
            }
            if (totalshotcount >= maxshot)
            {
                maxtimer = 1;
            }
            snd_play(snd_hurt1);
            bul = instance_create(eyex + 28 + x, eyey + 32 + y, obj_regularbullet);
            bul.speed = 2 / global.fps_scale;
            bul.timepoints = 2.5;
            bul.target = mytarget;
            bul.damage = global.monsterat[myself] * 5;
            bul.friction = -0.11 / (global.fps_scale * global.fps_scale);
            if (pontotal == 1)
            {
                bul.friction = -0.12 / (global.fps_scale * global.fps_scale);
            }
            bul.direction = eye_angle;
            with (bul)
            {
                sprite_index = spr_diamondbullet;
                image_angle = direction;
            }
        }
    }
    if (maxtimer > 0)
    {
        maxtimer += (1 / global.fps_scale);
    }
    if (global.turntimer < 10)
    {
        eyecon = 10;
    }
}
siner += (1 / global.fps_scale);
shotbuffer -= (1 / global.fps_scale);
if (becomesleep == 1)
{
    eyecon = 999;
    sleeping = 1;
    becomesleep = 0;
    sleep_index = 5;
}
if (eye_angle < 0)
{
    eye_angle += 360;
}
if (eye_angle > 360)
{
    eye_angle -= 360;
}
eyex = lengthdir_x(eye_radius, eye_angle);
eyey = lengthdir_y(eye_radius, eye_angle);

enum e__VW
{
    XView,
    YView,
    WView,
    HView,
    Angle,
    HBorder,
    VBorder,
    HSpeed,
    VSpeed,
    Object,
    Visible,
    XPort,
    YPort,
    WPort,
    HPort,
    Camera,
    SurfaceID
}
");

