            msgnextloc(""\\m1\t\t*Like some... little weird guy.&\\m3\tHe wanted us to sneak into&\tQueen's mansion...&\\m2\tWe're just rebels, we don't&\twanna get in trouble!/"", ""obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_585_0"");
